---
source: crates/whetstone/tests/it/settings.rs
expression: session.frame()
---
Buffer {
    area: Rect { x: 0, y: 0, width: 120, height: 32 },
    content: [
        "                                                                                                                        ",
        "  Settings                                                                                                              ",
        "  Read from ~/.config/whetstone/config.toml. Settings is read-only: edit that file to change them.                      ",
        "                                                                                                                        ",
        "    Provider              OpenRouter (default)                                                                          ",
        "    Jev model             typesafe/jev-1.14 (default)                                                                   ",
        "    Generator model       anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5 (default)                                                         ",
        "    OpenRouter key        not set (OPENROUTER_API_KEY)                                                                  ",
        "  > Colours               none                                                                                          ",
        "    Connected code limit  100 KB (default)                                                                              ",
        "    Questions             4 (default)                                                                                   ",
        "    Assessment policy     version 1, not validated                                                                      ",
        "    Cut-offs              upper 0.8, lower 0.2 for every other job (default)                                            ",
        "                          answer probe: upper 0.6, lower 0.2 (default)                                                  ",
        "                                                                                                                        ",
        "    Back                                                                                                                ",
        "                                                                                                                        ",
        "  How much colour Whetstone draws with: auto, 24-bit, 256, 16 or none. Auto reads COLORTERM, then TERM. Set a level     ",
        "  when your terminal shows more than it reports, as over SSH, or less when colours look wrong. A non-empty NO_COLOR     ",
        "  turns colour off, whatever this says.                                                                                 ",
        "  In config.toml: colours = "none"                                                                                      ",
        "                                                                                                                        ",
        "                                                                                                                        ",
        "                                                                                                                        ",
        "                                                                                                                        ",
        "                                                                                                                        ",
        "                                                                                                                        ",
        "                                                                                                                        ",
        "                                                                                                                        ",
        "                                                                                                                        ",
        "  ? keys  : actions  q back                                                                                             ",
        "                                                                                                                        ",
    ],
    styles: [
        x: 0, y: 0, fg: Reset, bg: Reset, underline: Reset, modifier: NONE,
        x: 2, y: 1, fg: Reset, bg: Reset, underline: Reset, modifier: BOLD,
        x: 10, y: 1, fg: Reset, bg: Reset, underline: Reset, modifier: NONE,
        x: 2, y: 8, fg: Reset, bg: Reset, underline: Reset, modifier: BOLD,
        x: 11, y: 8, fg: Reset, bg: Reset, underline: Reset, modifier: NONE,
    ]
}
